  notes: 'BS4 Station - Waiting (direction B, Level 0 floors below the first; Red 10-22 21:11, walls 2 Post Room by the map''s station skin). Plan W'' rev 3/4 (research/station/30_look.md 9-10) on the floor station contract: E1 west wall north cell 1.70 m on the set''s axis (z 4.80), E2 south wall east cell 1.20 m at the staff strip''s end. The set on its bracket on the east wall, the key on the north wall 38 deg off the screen axis, 1.9 m. Held only in the profile''s stationWaiting, never in the pool, never turned. Existing kits stand in for the tandem beams, magazine rack and smoking stand.'
